  "slug": "banquet-order-incident-report-form",
  "title": "Banquet Order Incident Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Record a service or food-safety incident during a banquet function, stop what needs stopping, and route the decision to the manager on duty.",
  "description": "An original incident record for banquet service. It captures incident identity and the service stage, the factual account with the covers affected, the immediate response including any service stop, qualified review by the manager on duty, corrective actions with verification, and a closeout that names residual risk.",
  "use_case": "Use when something goes wrong during a banquet function: a restricted plate reaches the wrong guest, a holding temperature falls outside the venue standard, a guest reports illness or injury, or service fails materially. The report closes only after the manager on duty has reviewed it and corrective actions are verified.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
