          "key": "record_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Record boundary for this report",
          "guidance": "Record observed facts, times, and actions. Do not record a guest's medical history, diagnosis, or treatment detail, do not state a cause of illness, and do not record conclusions about liability or staff discipline. Collect only the guest contact detail needed to follow up, and handle it under applicable privacy policy."
        }
