          "key": "response_actions",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Immediate response actions",
          "items": [
            "Affected plates removed from the floor and held, not discarded",
            "Remaining covers of the same item held pending the chef's decision",
            "Chef on duty attended and confirmed the disposition of held food",
            "Guest offered assistance and the offer recorded",
            "Client on-site contact informed by the manager on duty",
            "Affected area made safe and marked where a spill or breakage occurred",
            "Equipment taken out of service and tagged where it failed",
            "Holding temperatures rechecked across every remaining station"
          ],
          "guidance": "An unticked action is an open response gap."
        },
        {
          "key": "response_notes",
          "type": "textarea",
          "label": "What was done, in what order, and what the guest and client were told",
