          "key": "authority_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Stop conditions and authority boundary",
          "guidance": "Stop service and route to the responsible manager before continuing whenever a guest reports illness or injury, a restricted plate reached the wrong guest, a holding temperature is outside the venue standard, or a foreign object is reported. This report does not diagnose illness, determine the cause of harm, decide liability, or authorize compensation, and it does not replace the review applicable policy requires."
